但这里必须有一定的抢先入场成分
Again, there had to be an element of preemptive strike.

101
00:04:44,690 --> 00:04:50,650
不过我们之前也提到过，当潜在收益足够时，有时确实需要抢先入场
But we did talk about, sometimes you do have to preempt when the necessary reward is there.

104
00:04:50,650 --> 00:04:54,070
