We got, again, some more absorption at the higher prices before that—one last lift.

111
00:05:09,530 --> 00:05:14,090
在94价位上我们看到了承诺，然后市场就止损单触发了
We saw the commitment at 94s before the market then stopped up.

113
00:05:14,170 --> 00:05:18,430
