You want it to allow you a chance.

115
00:05:20,790 --> 00:05:25,450
但说到底，既然突破已经发生，规则就开始生效了
But ultimately, now that we’ve had the breakout, rules are ultimately in play.

117
00:05:25,450 --> 00:05:27,430
现在，突破交易的规则是什么呢？很简单
Now, what are those breakout rules? It’s simple.

118
00:05:27,610 --> 00:05:34,047
如果没赶上初始突破，我们就等市场回踩、吸筹
If we’re not on the initial breakout, we’re looking for the market to ultimately pull back, absorb,

119
00:05:34,047 --> 00:05:39,468
给我们一个吸筹区域，让我们能在别人寻找流动性的时候入场
give us an area of absorption and allow us in where people are searching for liquidity.

122
00:05:39,470 --> 00:05:48,470
注意，94到93价位，一直到09价位之间是低成交量区域
Now, do note, obviously, the low-volume area between 94s, 93s, all the way up to 09s.

124
00:05:48,610 --> 00:05:51,610
这是一个低成交量区域，同时也是失衡区域
This is a low-volume area but also an imbalance area.

125
00:05:51,630 --> 00:05:54,910
所以只要这个区域守住，突破就是有效的
So, as long as that holds, the breakout is good.

126
00:05:55,010 --> 00:05:58,770
现在，我们可以看到市场在上行方向上延伸得非常激进
Now, we can see the market extending quite aggressively to the upside.

128
00:05:59,090 --> 00:06:02,350
注意整体成交量以及Delta的变化
Note the overall volume trading as well as the delta.

130
00:06:02,350 --> 00:06:07,970
非常有趣的是，注意突破前轮动中的成交量
Now, very interestingly, note the volume that we had in that previous rotation just before the break.

132
00:06:08,090 --> 00:06:11,170
所以，我一直说，你得寻找那些微妙的线索
So, as I always say, You’ve got to look for those subtle clues.

134
00:06:11,590 --> 00:06:14,690
本质上，有一个微妙线索显示有事情正在酝酿
In essence, there was a subtle clue that something was brewing.

135
00:06:15,150 --> 00:06:20,250
这是我们在这个例子中看到的成交量最高的轮动
It was the highest-volume rotation we’ve had in this example.

137
00:06:20,950 --> 00:06:24,650
而它正好出现在下一次轮动之前，也就是我们看到那次快速拉升的时候
And it came just before the next rotation, which is when we got that snap high.

139
00:06:24,650 --> 00:06:29,710
所以，线索都在那里，突破机会的微妙信号都在那里
So, the clues were there, the subtleties were there for the breakout opportunity.

141
00:06:29,910 --> 00:06:31,270
不过话说回来
However, that being said,

142
00:06:31,270 --> 00:06:33,310
如果我们错过了这个机会
if we do miss that opportunity,

143
00:06:39,430 --> 00:06:41,810
我们可以在吸筹点位入场
and we enter upon the absorption points.

146
00:06:41,850 --> 00:06:47,990
所以，我们再次看到市场形成了一个激进的吸筹-派发阶段
So, again, we can see the market forming a nice aggressive accumulation and distribution.

148
00:06:48,290 --> 00:06:51,650
注意高成交量所发出的信号
Note the high volumes signaling that.

149
00:06:51,650 --> 00:06:55,190
我们继续看到市场保持横盘
So, again, we continue to see the market move sideways.

150
00:06:55,530 --> 00:06:56,990
价格随即回落
Market comes down.

151
00:06:57,190 --> 00:06:59,270
