I just want to show you that point of absorption.

152
00:06:59,750 --> 00:07:01,670
注意这些深色区域
So, again, note the dark colors.

153
00:07:01,890 --> 00:07:07,290
非常明显，多头正坐等，吸收一切可能的抛盘
Really, really evident that we are seeing buyers sitting, absorbing whatever they can.

155
00:07:07,290 --> 00:07:09,610
不止一次，而是两次
Not just once, but twice.

156
00:07:10,310 --> 00:07:12,830
价格再次回落
The market comes down again.

157
00:07:13,010 --> 00:07:19,450
第三次，在25价位附近又出现吸收
A third time, we see absorption again at 25s.

158
00:07:19,530 --> 00:07:22,370
于是市场进入横盘交易阶段
So, this market enters a phase of sideways trading.

159
00:07:22,510 --> 00:07:24,990
现在来看看我们当时如何入场
Now, let's have a look at how we could have entered here.

161
00:07:26,430 --> 00:07:30,570
突破交易中，我们寻找的是回踩点
Obviously, in terms of the breakout trading, we're looking for a pullback point.

163
00:07:30,670 --> 00:07:33,730
和主动推动阶段一样，没有精确的回踩点
Like in the initiative drive, there's no exact pullback point.

165
00:07:33,770 --> 00:07:35,230
我们可以考虑很多因素
There are a number of things we can consider.

166
00:07:35,230 --> 00:07:39,770
显然，可以关注之前的关键吸收点
Obviously, we can look for previous key absorption points.

168
00:07:39,770 --> 00:07:45,910
可能在10、11，甚至12价位附近有强吸收
Maybe around the 10s, 11s, or even the 12s with strong absorption there.

171
00:07:46,110 --> 00:07:50,850
可以寻找失衡区域的填补，或者之前的关键波动高点或低点
We can look for a fill of an imbalance, or consider a key previous swing high or low.

173
00:07:50,910 --> 00:07:57,570
最终，我们寻找任何能提示入场点的线索
Ultimately, we're looking for anything that gives us an idea of where to enter.

175
00:07:57,590 --> 00:08:00,850
在这个例子中，再次注意这些深色阴影
In this example, notice the dark shading again.

176
00:08:00,850 --> 00:08:02,150
这才是真正的关键线索
That was the real clue here.

177
00:08:02,330 --> 00:08:09,210
我们不仅看到主动卖盘被吸收——多头还在积极加仓
We're seeing not only aggressive selling being absorbed—buyers are happily reloading.

178
00:08:09,350 --> 00:08:12,130
多头同时也在买入
Buyers are also buying at the same time.

179
00:08:12,330 --> 00:08:17,050
这是多头在这个价位有意图的强烈信号
That’s a strong signal that buyers are intentional around this point.

181
00:08:17,150 --> 00:08:22,636
这最终成为我们的止损位，之后价格重新上涨
And that ultimately then acts as our stop-down, before the market then returns back higher.

183
00:08:22,636 --> 00:08:25,928
这是一个非常典型的突破交易案例
So, a really, really good example of a breakout.

184
00:08:27,990 --> 00:08:31,102
注意，突破后入场，我们要考虑何时离场
Do note, with the breakout, where we get out, once we enter,

185
00:08:31,102 --> 00:08:32,917
如果是第一次突破入场
whether it’s on the first break,

186
00:08:32,917 --> 00:08:38,107
我们不想在出现二次延伸前离场
If we’re on the first break, we don’t want to get out until we have that secondary extension.

190
00:08:38,450 --> 00:08:41,223
如果是在第二次回踩入场
If we’re getting in on the second pullback,

191
00:08:41,223 --> 00:08:45,227
同样要等延伸，并跟随动能移动止损
again, we’re looking for that extension, trailing that stop with the momentum.

193
00:08:45,610 --> 00:08:50,649
我们不想重新回到之前的横盘区间
We don’t really want to be entering back into that previous rotation.

194
00:08:50,649 --> 00:08:53,362
好，这就是我们的突破交易案例
Okay, so that’s our breakout example,

195
00:08:53,362 --> 00:08:58,788
一个非常经典的案例，无论是入场点还是信号点
a really neat example in terms of entry points, in terms of signal points.

197
00:08:59,110 --> 00:09:03,772
至于目标位，我其实不太想花太多时间
In terms of targets, again, I don’t like to spend too much time

198
00:09:03,772 --> 00:09:06,769
因为目标位是很个人的事情
mulling over targets because it’s a personal thing.

201
00:09:06,850 --> 00:09:10,646
我什么时候出场，你什么时候出场，大家什么时候出场
Where I get out, where you get out, where everyone gets out,

202
00:09:10,646 --> 00:09:14,126
都取决于我们最终想要达到什么目的
it all depends on what we’re ultimately trying to achieve.

204
00:09:15,431 --> 00:09:17,711
它们会进入价格发现模式
they do go into price discovery mode,

205
00:09:17,711 --> 00:09:19,666
而根据这个定义本身
which means, by that very definition,

206
00:09:19,666 --> 00:09:24,229
市场应该会比你想象的再走得远一点
the market should go a little bit further than what you might think. Okay,

207
00:09:24,410 --> 00:09:27,450
突破完全取决于流动性提供的位置
the breakout is purely dependent on where the liquidity is provided.

209
00:09:27,770 --> 00:09:31,366
所以如果有人愿意提供流动性，价格就会停下来；如果没有人提供
So if someone’s willing to provide liquidity, the market will stop. If they’re not,

211
00:09:32,490 --> 00:09:39,050
价格就会持续寻找所需的流动性。这就是我们突破策略演练的总结
until it finds the desired liquidity. That's a wrap-up of our drill session on the breakout strategy.

212
00:09:39,510 --> 00:09:42,010
第14单元再见
Join me again when we go to Unit 14.
